{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "css.responsive-css.media-queries-and-breakpoints.choose-content-breakpoint.001",
  "revision": 1,
  "slug": "choose-content-breakpoint",
  "title": "实现内容驱动的 breakpoint",
  "prompt": "先根据 fixture 的空间预算判断为什么横向 nav 需要接近 600px 的 viewport：4 个 links 各至少 120px，加 3 个 12px gaps 需要 516px 的 nav content width；再加 nav 自身左右 padding/border 与 body 左右 padding，约需要 590px viewport，因此本题用 600px 留出少量余量。基于这个已解释的 break，写 600px 的 mobile-first min-width rule，并在 390/768/1280 对照结果。",
  "order": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "hints": [
    "先做完整空间预算，不要按设备名称选数字：4×120px + 3×12px = 516px；还要把 nav 自身的 horizontal padding/border 和 body 的左右 padding 算进 viewport 需求。",
    "这些固定 fixture 数值合计约需要 590px viewport，所以本题用 600px 作为有少量余量的 content-driven 练习阈值。",
    "保留 block baseline，并在 `@media (min-width: 600px)` 中让 nav 变为 flex、gap 12px，links 变为 inline-block。"
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-display-block-baseline",
      "type": "rule-style",
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "block",
      "message": "为 nav 保留窄空间 block baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-link-display-block-baseline",
      "type": "rule-style",
      "selector": ".nav a",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "block",
      "message": "让 nav link 在窄空间逐行显示"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-display-flex-wide",
      "type": "rule-style",
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "flex",
      "media": "(min-width: 600px)",
      "message": "在内容需要时切换 nav 为 flex"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-gap-wide",
      "type": "rule-style",
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "gap",
      "equals": "12px",
      "media": "(min-width: 600px)",
      "message": "为宽空间 nav links 设置间距"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-link-display-inline-block-wide",
      "type": "rule-style",
      "selector": ".nav a",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "inline-block",
      "media": "(min-width: 600px)",
      "message": "在宽空间让 nav link 参与横向布局"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-display-mobile",
      "type": "viewport-style",
      "viewportWidth": 390,
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "block",
      "message": "在 390px 视口使用 block nav"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-display-tablet",
      "type": "viewport-style",
      "viewportWidth": 768,
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "flex",
      "message": "在 768px 视口使用 flex nav"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose-nav-display-desktop",
      "type": "viewport-style",
      "viewportWidth": 1280,
      "selector": ".nav",
      "property": "display",
      "equals": "flex",
      "message": "在 1280px 视口使用 flex nav"
    }
  ]
}
